% Scenario: an unknown kind is tolerated. No error is raised, the page
% is delivered as usual, the .ir golden records the mark as ignored,
% and the command-line tool reports one ignored pdfmark of kind NOSUCH.
[ /Foo 1 /NOSUCH pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
